 What a USER Can Do

  Pages Accessible
  ┌────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │      Page      │                  Details                   │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Dashboard      │ Personal stats only (own invoices)         │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Invoices       │ List/view own invoices only                │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Invoice Create │ Create new invoices (as draft)             │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Invoice Detail │ View own invoice details                   │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Invoice Edit   │ Edit own draft invoices                    │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Clients        │ Client management                          │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Payments       │ View own payment records (no global stats) │
  ├────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Profile        │ View/edit own profile                      │
  └────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  Invoice Features

  - Create invoices (draft)
  - Edit own draft invoices
  - View invoice details & download PDFs
  - Send validated invoices
  - Cancel invoices

  User Account

  - View own profile (GET /api/users/me)
  - Update own profile (PUT /api/users/{ownId})
  - Change own password (PUT /api/users/me/password)
  - Delete own account

  Payments, Cards & Subscriptions

  - Create/manage own cards
  - Create/manage own subscriptions
  - View own payment history

  ---
  What a USER CANNOT Do (Admin-Only)

  Restricted Pages
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │                      Page                       │              Restriction Source               │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Users Management (/admin/users)                 │ RoleGuard + @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Subscriptions Management (/admin/subscriptions) │ RoleGuard                                     │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Cards Management (/admin/cards)                 │ RoleGuard                                     │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Settings (/admin/settings)                      │ RoleGuard                                     │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  Restricted Invoice Actions (from permissions.ts)

  - Validate invoices (invoices.validate → ADMIN only)
  - Delete invoices (invoices.delete → ADMIN only)
  - Mark invoices as paid (invoices.markPaid → ADMIN only)

  Restricted Data Visibility

  - Global dashboard stats (dashboard.globalStats → ADMIN only)
  - Global payment stats (payments.globalStats → ADMIN only)
  - Users see only their own invoices/data; admins see everything

  Restricted API Endpoints

  - GET /api/users — list all users (ADMIN only via @PreAuthorize)
  - POST /api/users — create new users (ADMIN only via @PreAuthorize)
  - DELETE /api/users/{id} — delete other users' accounts (runtime check)

  ---
  Security Note

  The backend invoice service relies mostly on frontend filtering (passing ownerUserId as a query parameter) rather than backend @PreAuthorize annotations. This
  means the access control for invoices is primarily enforced on the frontend side — a regular user could theoretically access other users' invoices by
  manipulating API calls directly. Only the user-auth-service has proper backend role enforcement with @PreAuthorize.


